{
  "about": "project-datum 6679: every shipped feature is reachable and described through MCP. One row per feature: `say` is text its tool's description or input schema must contain (tools/list, one source with the docs), `calls` are real tools/call requests and what their answers must carry. Run by mcp::tools::exposure (cargo test -p beatscript-serve, the real Tools) and by crates/beatscript-serve/deploy/mcp-exposure.py (live, MCP over HTTPS, in every beatscript.app deploy script). expect: [pointer, op, value]: = equal, has present and not null, ~ the value (as JSON text) contains, !~ it does not, ^ it starts with. save: {name: pointer} keeps a value for ${name} in later args. auth: needs a signed-in caller (and for eval, load and queue a tab); stores: stores a program on the site; live, both run only with a token (and a call whose ${name} was not saved is skipped). Every page in docs/beatscript/*.md is a row's `docs` or a `not_features` entry with its reason: a new page fails the test until it has one.",
  "not_features": {
    "ext-algebra.md": "the language (stack, then, silence): check compiles it; BEATSCRIPT.md and the cheat sheet teach it",
    "ext-answer.md": "the language (call and response): check compiles it",
    "ext-arith.md": "the language (arithmetic): check compiles it",
    "ext-assert.md": "the language (assertions): check compiles it",
    "ext-chance.md": "the language (seeded chance): check compiles it",
    "ext-linked.md": "the language (#! genre / #! tags / JSON-LD): check compiles it; the genre-conventions row covers #! genre",
    "ext-meter.md": "the language (Euclidean rhythms, polymeter): check compiles it",
    "ext-mix.md": "the language (duck, mix): check compiles it",
    "ext-perform.md": "the language (the performed tier): check compiles it",
    "ext-ports.md": "the language (typed ports, wire): check compiles it",
    "ext-render.md": "the offline render's control lines: render's own description says what it plays",
    "ext-scale.md": "the language (scale degrees, Roman numerals): check compiles it",
    "ext-shape.md": "the language (shapes, lfo): check compiles it",
    "ext-sing.md": "the language (sing): check compiles it; the lexicon and found-phrases rows cover what MCP adds",
    "ext-sugar.md": "the language (pattern sugar): check compiles it",
    "ext-tempo.md": "the language (tempo curves): check compiles it",
    "ext-timing.md": "the language (sub-bar timing): check compiles it",
    "showcase.md": "one example track, not a feature"
  },
